Subject: [PATCH]  src/lst/segmented_path.rs: PART 3

- Do not use Pin, as we're only ever returning shared `&`, never
  `&mut`. (Still leave `_pin` in, just in case that changes later.)

-------------------------------- src/bin/lst.rs --------------------------------

- since we now have 2 different path implementations, move the
  continuation from that point on to its own parameterized
  continuation function, `main_cont`
